<title>MEXICO: Mexico cattle report, feeder export price - USDA.</title>
<headline>Mexico cattle report, feeder export price - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Monday that no head were exported into the United States at crossing points on Friday.</p>
